  "description": "MCPBuckle is a comprehensive .NET library that generates Model Context Protocol (MCP) JSON from ASP.NET Core API metadata with full MCPInvoke 1.4.0+ compatibility. Features advanced schema generation with route parameter extraction, parameter source detection, inheritance chain walking, and complex object introspection. Version 1.7.0 adds critical fixes for [FromQuery] complex object detection and inheritance chain property walking to ensure base class properties are properly included in MCP tool definitions.",
